  "markdown": "# The Legend of “Ship dark mode for the settings page, behind a PR”\n\n*A party of three · 1m 56s · 96.8k tokens · $0.155*\n\nIt began at the quest board: “Ship dark mode for the settings page, behind a PR”. The Guildmaster called two adventurers to the work.\n\n## I. The Guildmaster at the Quest Board\n\n*0:00–1:56 (1m 56s) · 27.5k tokens · $0.044*\n\n- **Deeds:** 7 commands\n- **Failure** (0:39): CI failed on dark-mode, and the lighthouse burned red.\n- **Rise** (1:10): CI passed again on dark-mode; the lighthouse burned warm.\n- **Renown** (1:12): Pull request #128 “Dark mode for the settings page” was merged; its ship sailed into the harbour.\n- **Renown** (1:34): Released v1.4.0 “Dark mode”: a galleon came into the harbour.\n- **Renown** (1:56): Came home clean; the village held a festival in their honour.\n\n## II. The Artisan — “Add dark theme tokens and wire the settings page”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 0:02–0:16 (14s)*\n\n- **Deeds:** 2 edits, 1 test run, 1 read\n- **Loot:** Dark tokens added; the settings page follows prefers-color-scheme.\n\n## III. The Artisan — “Fix: raise muted-text contrast to 4.5 in dark mode”\n\n*Called back by the Guildmaster · 0:42–0:49 (7s) · 41.8k tokens · $0.067 for both quests*\n\n- **Deeds:** 1 edit, 1 test run\n- **Loot:** Muted text lifted to #a3a3a3: 4.6 contrast; snapshot updated.\n\n## IV. The Archivist — “Write the v1.4.0 changelog entry for dark mode”\n\n*Sent by the Guildmaster · 1:36–1:50 (14s) · 27.5k tokens · $0.044*\n\n- **Deeds:** 2 edits, 2 reads\n- **Loot:** v1.4.0 in the changelog and the theming docs: dark settings page, muted text at 4.6 contrast.\n\n## Deeds of Renown\n\n- **A Clean Sweep**: The whole quest came home clean — 17 deeds, not one failed — and the village held a festival.\n\n---\n\n> Dark mode shipped: PR #128 merged after a contrast fix, CI green, v1.4.0 released and logged.\n\n*The quest was done in 1m 56s; the loot is home and the hearth is warm.*\n",
